ers, they were extremely angry and clashing warriors.491."},"pu":{"ss":"ਜੋ ਕ੍ਰੋਧਵਾਨ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਲੜਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੪੯੧॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9258,"next":9260}}